# Workflow: Write Tests

## 1. Inspect the change
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `.ai/project_profile.yaml`
- Identify the smallest behavior slice that needs coverage
- Confirm the repo's available test commands

## 2. Pick the right scope
- Server routes, middleware, services, and models
- Client components, pages, and state stores
- AI fallbacks, parsing, and prompt-adjacent behavior
- Important end-to-end flows when unit tests are not enough

## 3. Write deterministic tests
- Mock external services and unstable dependencies
- Use stable fixtures and readable assertions
- Focus on behavior that a user would notice

## 4. Validate
- Run the narrowest relevant tests first
- Expand to broader coverage if the change touches shared logic

## 5. Report
- Summarize what was covered
- Call out any missing test tooling or intentional gaps
